Modifications made to produce TR10_cmp_sc
-----------------------------------------
  * library renamed to `TR10_cmp_sc`; Liberty corner renamed to
    `TR10_cmp_sc_typ_5p0V_25C`;
  * power pins replaced by TR10 full-width abutment rails on M1, with the
    PDK supply names VDD/GND; TAP2/TAP3 keep the source M2 rail stubs;
  * a TR10 technology LEF added (5.4 um site/track pitch, M1 1.8/1.4,
    M2 3.4/2.0) and the layer names remapped to M1/V1/M2;
  * the GDS power labels renamed vdd/vss -> VDD/GND, flip-flop debug
    labels and the C4004 `via_1` helper cell removed, TIEHI/TIELO added;
  * two cell-LEF views emitted (M1-pin GRT view and M2-pin DRT view with a
    full-cell M1/V1 obstruction), plus CDL/SPICE/Verilog wrappers;
  * `TR10_cmp_sc_v1hole.lef` and the `TAP_SOURCE_M2`/`TAP_M2_OBS` generator
    switches are measurement variants (not part of the default views).

The place-and-route flow, the two-LEF/expanded-guide recipe, the
`add_well_bridges.py` well fill and everything under `flow/` and
`examples/` are original work of this PDK and are not part of the
upstream library.

